{
  "name": "Detect Portal",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the ability to magically sense the presence of a planar portal. As an Action, you detect the distance and direction to the closest planar portal within 1 mile of you.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p><p>See the \"Planar Travel\" section in chapter 2 of the Dungeon Master's Guide for examples of planar portals.</p>",
